{"suttaId":"tha-ap87","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4843,4858],"vripara":"30"},"segments":{"tha-ap87:0.3":"Raṃsisaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap87:1.1":"“Pabbate himavantamhi, vāsaṃ kappesahaṃ pure;","tha-ap87:1.3":"Ajinuttaravāsohaṃ, vasāmi pabbatantare.","tha-ap87:2.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, sataraṃsiṃva bhāṇumaṃ;","tha-ap87:2.3":"Vanantaragataṃ disvā, sālarājaṃva pupphitaṃ.","tha-ap87:3.1":"“Raṃsyā [raṃse (syā. ka.)] cittaṃ pasādetvā, vipassissa mahesino;","tha-ap87:3.3":"Paggayha añjaliṃ vandiṃ, sirasā ukkuṭī [sirasā ukkuṭiko (syā.), sirasukkuṭiko (ka.)] ahaṃ.","tha-ap87:4.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap87:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, raṃsisaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap87:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap87:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā raṃsisaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap87:7.1":"Raṃsisaññakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2730,"to":2730,"paras":[{"para":2730,"vripara":"30","refs":["tha-ap87:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>pabbate himavantamhī</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>pabbate</b>ti pakārena brūhati vaḍḍhetīti pabbato, himo assa atthīti himavanto, himavanto ca so pabbato cāti himavantapabbato.","Himavantapabbateti vattabbe gāthāvacanasukhatthaṃ “pabbate himavantamhī”ti vuttaṃ.","Tasmiṃ himavantamhi pabbate vāsaṃ kappesiṃ pure ahanti sambandho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha nayānusārena uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap87:1"],["tha-ap87:1"],["tha-ap87:1"],["tha-ap87:1"],["tha-ap87:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap87:1.1","pabbate himavantamhī",0,0],["tha-ap87:1.1","pabbate",0,1],["tha-ap87:1.3","pabbate",0,1]]},"tika":null}
